OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, the rain occasional
OL,7,Fheavy and persistent with cloud
OL,8,Flowering onto the hills. Breezy at
OL,9,Ftimes around Irish Sea coasts.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain or showers
OL,12,Fwill push northwards during the
OL,13,Fevening. Drier and clearer conditions
OL,14,Freturning from the west overnight.
OL,15,FBreezy around the coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FMainly dry and bright in the
OL,18,Fmorning. Cloud increasing with
OL,19,Foccasional rain or showers during the
OL,20,Fafternoon, the rain turning persistent
OL,21,Fand heavy in the south later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
