OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith bright spells and showers on
OL,7,FFriday, the showers becoming light and
OL,8,Fwell scattered on Saturday with easing
OL,9,Fwinds. Heavy rain expected on Sunday.
